appear by proxy

.', '[{"label": "A", "text": "be present in person", "isCorrect": true}, {"label": "B", "text": "be represented by a counsel", "isCorrect": false}, {"label": "C", "text": "not appear at all", "isCorrect": false}, {"label": "D", "text": "answer questions by phone", "isCorrect": false}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'To ''appear by proxy'' means to be represented by someone else rather than attending in person; its opposite is ''be present in person''.', 'live', '{"totalAttempts": 0, "correctCount": 0, "avgResponseTimeMs": 0, "distractorSelectionCounts": {}}'::jsonb),
('use_of_english_0306', 'Use of English', 'Synonyms/antonyms', 'Synonyms', NULL, '[{"weight": 1, "conceptId": "r0mfcp"}]'::jsonb, '{}', 2, 'recall', 60, 'low', 'none', '[{"option": "A", "explanation": "''Attractive'' describes appearance, not energy level.", "misconceptionId": "misunderstood_terminology"}, {"option": "B", "explanation": "''Howling'' describes a specific sound the dog makes, not general liveliness.", "misconceptionId": "confused_similar_concepts"}, {"option": "C", "explanation": "''Barking'' is also just a specific sound, not a synonym for being lively.", "misconceptionId": "confused_similar_concepts"}]'::jsonb, '{}', 'jamb_past_question', 2005, 'JAMB', '{}', 'Choose the

