If the rain hadn''t fallen, we wouldn''t have missed the match?', '[{"label": "A", "text": "The rain is falling, so we will miss the match", "isCorrect": false}, {"label": "B", "text": "The rain fell, so we didn''t watch the match", "isCorrect": true}, {"label": "C", "text": "The rain didn''t fall, so we didn''t watch the match", "isCorrect": false}, {"label": "D", "text": "The rain didn''t fall, so we didn''t miss the match", "isCorrect": false}]'::jsonb, 'B', 'The third conditional (''if...hadn''t...wouldn''t have'') describes contrary-to-fact past events: the rain actually DID fall, and we actually DID miss the match.', 'live', '{"totalAttempts": 0, "correctCount": 0, "avgResponseTimeMs": 0, "distractorSelectionCounts": {}}'::jsonb),
