decision changed the company''s outlook in many ways.', '[{"label": "A", "text": "wonderful", "isCorrect": false}, {"label": "B", "text": "disastrous", "isCorrect": true}, {"label": "C", "text": "uncontrollable", "isCorrect": false}, {"label": "D", "text": "unsuccessful", "isCorrect": false}]'::jsonb, 'B', '''Fateful'' describes a decision with momentous, often disastrous, consequences; ''disastrous'' is the nearest match here.', 'live', '{"totalAttempts": 0, "correctCount": 0, "avgResponseTimeMs": 0, "distractorSelectionCounts": {}}'::jsonb);